# Scope map for @ancplua/*, kept for Renovate and for any future GitHub Packages
# dependency (e.g. @ancplua/typespec-otel-semconv). It no longer covers the three
# emitters: they are bun/npm workspace members under emitters/ and resolve locally,
# because bun COPIES a file: dependency -- and copies it before `prepare` builds
# dist/ -- leaving TypeSpec with a library that has no dist/index.js.
# NOTE: this repo's OWN package (@ancplua/qyl-api-schema) PUBLISHES to npmjs.org, not GitHub Packages
# — publish.yml forces that past this scope map with --@ancplua:registry=https://registry.npmjs.org.
@ancplua:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
